00:21:44.325 --> 00:21:46.076
I AM A SHIT BUG

00:21:55.502 --> 00:22:00.174
Boring, boring, boring, boring!

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:07.765
Watch this, Baudelaire!

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:49.974
Kasuga...

00:22:58.607 --> 00:23:00.651
It was just as I thought.

00:23:02.444 --> 00:23:04.446
You're a true pervert.

00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:12.246
TO BE CONTINUED

00:23:48.115 --> 00:23:49.782
ON THE NEXT EPISODE

00:23:49.783 --> 00:23:52.369
In despair over himself,
Kasuga runs off with Nakamura.

00:23:53.037 --> 00:23:56.373
But Saeki does not intend
to let go of Kasuga.

00:23:57.082 --> 00:23:58.417
Next, on episode four.

00:23:59.209 --> 00:24:02.045
Three souls, soaked by the rain,
rub against each other.

00:24:02.046 --> 00:24:03.047
